      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Su historia empieza en la familia de Osiris, el rey bueno al que mató su hermano Set.",
          "en": "His story begins in the family of Osiris, the good king who was murdered by his brother Set."
        },
        {
          "es": "El escritor griego Plutarco dice que Anubis era hijo de Osiris y de Neftis, la esposa de Set.",
          "en": "The Greek writer Plutarch says Anubis was a son of Osiris and Nephthys, Set's wife."
        },
        {
          "es": "Neftis le tenía miedo a Set. Así que dejó al bebé solo, lejos de todos.",
          "en": "Nephthys was afraid of Set. So she left the baby alone, far away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Isis, la esposa de Osiris, lo buscó con ayuda de unos perros, y lo encontró.",
          "en": "Isis, the wife of Osiris, searched for him with the help of dogs, and found him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo crió como a un hijo. Y Anubis se volvió su guardián, fiel como un perro.",
          "en": "She raised him as her own. And Anubis became her guard, as loyal as a dog."
        }
      ],
